              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 38:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otini kimuchö, asïwan lö kiyata Kö pö Tororöt nyo mi yïm akimi ema kiporunöto Tororöt orinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlïtunö Kö pö Tororöt malaykenichay le mut nko odeny chay kipchini ngwïny kinyörilutchay le mut nko odeny. Kikilokyï chane sïro cho relach löka akitïng anankis cho kikïnöpchï koltin ompö töketwekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kutö akong ompö tyonchay le angwan sötote malaykenichoni le mut nko odeny pakulino koltin mut nko odeny cho kinyïghï nörekyo Tororöt nyoni söpöy kokay nko kokay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
